# Implement Phase 2: Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT)

Phase 2 builds the core training capabilities of the Local LLM Lab. We will implement QLoRA SFT using Hugging Face's `trl` and `peft` libraries to fine-tune `Qwen3.5-2B` on a synthetic coding dataset within the 8GB VRAM constraint.

## Goal
Implement a robust, resume-able QLoRA training script that monitors hardware limits (GPU Memory), logs training metrics (Loss, LR, Time), and correctly interfaces with the evaluation pipeline.

